Sources
-------
- jesther-ai/open-u60-pro (MIT): https://github.com/jesther-ai/open-u60-pro
- Later changes by Wei REN (install kit, eSIM, Tailscale, Home Mode, admin web
  redesign), snapshot 420a6d9 (2026-09-15).

This repository starts from a cleaned snapshot of that work, not from its git
history. Removed before publishing:
- device_report.json, ubus_probe_report.json (runtime dumps of a real device)
- web/public/images/ (vendor marketing photos)
- mobile/ (upstream's iOS/Android companion apps: never used here and out of
  date with this agent; they remain in the upstream repository)
- scripts/topflow/, PROFILE_MANAGER_PLAN.md, web/_backup/, web/vercel.json
  (private infrastructure and internal notes)
- .github/workflows/release.yml (binary releases are not published yet)
Maintainer-specific addresses and host names were replaced with device defaults.

Third-party components
----------------------
- Rust crates: see Cargo.lock; each crate keeps its own license.
- npm packages: see web/package-lock.json; each package keeps its own license.
- Prebuilt binaries used by onboard/build-kit.sh (dropbear, lpac and its Alpine
  libraries, zwrt-datad) are NOT included in this repository.

